  "item_short_desc": "<p>Conquer challenging terrains with our Jungle Boots, a fusion of combat boot durability and running shoe comfort, featuring a breathable canvas construction that keeps your feet cool and dry in any climate. The military uniform boot comes equipped with dual vent holes designed for arid, hot, and humid weather conditions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "69867",
  "description": "<p>Conquer challenging terrains with our Jungle Boots, a fusion of combat boot durability and running shoe comfort, featuring a breathable canvas construction that keeps your feet cool and dry in any climate. The military uniform boot comes equipped with dual vent holes designed for arid, hot, and humid weather conditions. Enhanced Grip: Navigate any terrain confidently with a vulcanized leather outsole with a cleated Panama sole for maximum traction that supports quick and sharp movements while out in the jungle, field, or other outdoor environments. Long-Lasting Support: The lightweight combat boot features an 8-inch height, canvas / nylon uppers, reinforced seams for dependable durability and ankle support. The internal steel stank helps reduce stain on your heel and calf while providing additional stability and support. Please note, Desert Tan style (item #: 5080) features a removable insole. Authentic Military Design: Crafted to original service specifications, these rugged all-terrain tactical boots are designed for reliability. In addition, these service boots feature a 9-eyelet lace system and a size larger fit for optimal performance. All-Terrain Dependability: Whether you are military personnel or airsoft players, these lightweight jungle boots easily withstand rigorous use through demanding situations while remaining comfortable and dry.</p>",
